":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"稱王、自號與用稱分開；延陵封邑不擅補正式爵等，未知時段不補造，不以卒日結束爵位。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji031-015","person_id":"cbr-p001034","surfaces":["王餘祭","餘祭"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p006","quote":"二十五年，王壽夢卒。壽夢有子四人，長曰諸樊，次曰餘祭，次曰餘眛，次曰季札。季札賢，而壽夢欲立之，季札讓不可，於是乃立長子諸樊，攝行事當國。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p008","quote":"十三年，王諸樊卒。有命授弟餘祭，欲傳以次，必致國於季札而止，以稱先王壽夢之意，且嘉季札之義，兄弟皆欲致國，令以漸至焉。季札封於延陵，故號曰延陵季子。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p009","quote":"王餘祭三年，齊相慶封有罪，自齊來犇吳。吳予慶封硃方之縣，以爲奉邑，以女妻之，富於在齊。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p017","quote":"十七年，王餘祭卒，弟餘眛立。"}],"rationale":"按本篇周初、吳世系、楚亡臣與列國稱號的敘事語境暫定異稱；同名不全庫替換，仲雍與周章弟虞仲分開。論樂的祖君稱號另保留候選，未按熟知故事合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p006","text":"二十五年，王壽夢卒。壽夢有子四人，長曰諸樊，次曰餘祭，次曰餘眛，次曰季札。季札賢，而壽夢欲立之，季札讓不可，於是乃立長子諸樊，攝行事當國。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m006-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"王壽夢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m006-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"壽夢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"諸樊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001033","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m006-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"餘祭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001034","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m006-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"餘眛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001035","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m006-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"季札","kind":"person","person_id"